{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of floating platforms, stubborn cubes, and brain-bending puzzles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, every step matters: one wrong move and you\u2019ll either fall, get caught by a cube with attitude, or watch the path literally explode beneath your feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Your mission is (apparently) simple: guide the player from the starting point all the way to the finish line!</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >250 hand-crafted levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/9e2840e9ab48a98153d39160f8f06b34.poster.avif?t=1770352546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/9e2840e9ab48a98153d39160f8f06b34.webm?t=1770352546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/9e2840e9ab48a98153d39160f8f06b34.mp4?t=1770352546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full level editor to design, play-test and share your own creations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/6ebeddd03440555de29a502acb5a2990.poster.avif?t=1770352546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/6ebeddd03440555de29a502acb5a2990.webm?t=1770352546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/6ebeddd03440555de29a502acb5a2990.mp4?t=1770352546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive tutorial, for all types of blocks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/a29ab8435ded34297378acde6c3aa17c.poster.avif?t=1770352546\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/a29ab8435ded34297378acde6c3aa17c.webm?t=1770352546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/a29ab8435ded34297378acde6c3aa17c.mp4?t=1770352546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An overview of the game block types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base</strong>: The plain, trusty tile. Safe to walk on, no tricks here</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall</strong>: Just what you\u2019d expect. It's in the way, and you can\u2019t pass through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teleporter</strong>: Instantly transport you from one spot to another.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Togglable</strong>: Either walkable, either not. Its state changes when you activate its linked switch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slider</strong>:\u00a0Conveyor-style tile that pushes you in a fixed direction, as long as nothing blocks the path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoint</strong>: Unlocks new parts of the map when stepped on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countdown:</strong>\u00a0Every time you step on it, its \u201clife\u201d ticks down. When it hits zero, it vanishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosible</strong>: A more dangerous version of countdowns. Once triggered, it keeps ticking down with every step you take. When time\u2019s up, it explodes, taking surrounding tiles (and maybe you) with it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal</strong>: Reach this, and you\u2019ve beaten the level!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also be able to join a Discord Community!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072070?t=1770352546","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072070?t=1770352546","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/4e01f96c058f5edf9e9b3a419d1d326c7e631bd1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770352546","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/4e01f96c058f5edf9e9b3a419d1d326c7e631bd1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770352546","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4108550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of floating platforms, stubborn cubes, and brain-bending puzzles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, every step matters: one wrong move and you\u2019ll either fall, get caught by a cube with attitude, or watch the path literally explode beneath your feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Your mission is (apparently) simple: guide the player from the starting point all the way to the finish line!</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\