source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/a29ab8435ded34297378acde6c3aa17c.webm?t=1770352546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072070/extras/a29ab8435ded34297378acde6c3aa17c.mp4?t=1770352546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An overview of the game block types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base</strong>: The plain, trusty tile. Safe to walk on, no tricks here</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall</strong>: Just what you\u2019d expect. It's in the way, and you can\u2019t pass through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teleporter</strong>: Instantly transport you from one spot to another.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Togglable</strong>: Either walkable, either not. Its state changes when you activate its linked switch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slider</strong>:\u00a0Conveyor-style tile that pushes you in a fixed direction, as long as nothing blocks the path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoint</strong>: Unlocks new parts of the map when stepped on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countdown:</strong>\u00a0Every time you step on it, its \u201clife\u201d ticks down. When it hits zero, it vanishes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosible</strong>: A more dangerous version of countdowns. Once triggered, it keeps ticking down with every step you take. When time\u2019s up, it explodes, taking surrounding tiles (and maybe you) with it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal</strong>: Reach this, and you\u2019ve beaten the level!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also be able to join a Discord Community!\u00a0</p>","developers":["HunterByte Digital"],"genres":[{"descriptio